{"id":"n93386-1-7","stage":4,"title":"더러 · 有时","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93386-1-7-1","ko":"근처 박물관에는 자주 가니?","zh":"你经常去附近的博物馆吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"근처","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박물관에는","meaning":"博物馆","explanation":"박물관：博物馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"박물관","audio":"/audio/9c844c75334ef5795590.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36677","senseId":"1","lemma":"박물관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가니?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"9c844c75334ef579","term":"박물관","zh":"博物馆","audio":"/audio/9c844c75334ef5795590.mp3","entryId":"36677","definition":"搜集、保存和陈列文物或艺术品以供人们欣赏或研究的设施。","pronunciation":["방물관"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc2cf4946d228ce6a5a2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93386-1-7-2","ko":"학교 끝나고 더러 가기도 해.","zh":"放学后偶尔也会去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더러","meaning":"有时","explanation":"더러：有时","readings":[{"term":"더러","audio":"/audio/c54b76fdf6e245f28197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93386","senseId":"1","lemma":"더러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가기도","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"表示有时也做（-기도 하다）","explanation":"하다：表示有时也做（-기도 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"5","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"c54b76fdf6e245f2","term":"더러","zh":"有时","audio":"/audio/c54b76fdf6e245f28197.mp3","entryId":"93386","definition":"偶尔，间或。","pronunciation":["더러"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示有时也做（-기도 하다）"